{"number": 42, "url": "https://github.com/oliverkidd/orion/pull/42", "title": "Attach links to worktrees", "state": "OPEN", "isDraft": false, "author": {"login": "shot-user"}, "baseRefName": "main", "headRefName": "attach-links", "additions": 188, "deletions": 23, "changedFiles": 5, "body": "A worktree can now carry saved links — the pull request it opened, a staging URL, a ticket — as rows of the SESSIONS PANEL's PULL REQUESTS group.\n\nEnter on a row hands the URL to the browser; the detected pull request is found by `gh pr view` on the branch and needs no saving at all.\n\nA saved link that *is* the pull request is shown once, as the pull-request row, so the same destination never appears twice.", "comments": [{"author": {"login": "reviewer"}, "createdAt": "2026-09-03T14:12:00Z", "body": "Tried it on a branch with no PR yet — the group stays empty until one opens, which is what I'd expect."}, {"author": {"login": "shot-user"}, "createdAt": "2026-09-03T15:40:00Z", "body": "Right — and the first GIT POLL after `gh pr create` picks it up without a restart."}], "reviews": [{"author": {"login": "reviewer"}, "submittedAt": "2026-09-04T09:05:00Z", "state": "APPROVED", "body": "Reads well; one nit on the dedupe inline."}], "files": [{"path": "crates/orion-tui/src/links.rs", "additions": 96, "deletions": 0, "changeType": "ADDED"}, {"path": "crates/orion-tui/src/app.rs", "additions": 41, "deletions": 12, "changeType": "MODIFIED"}, {"path": "crates/orion-tui/src/ui.rs", "additions": 33, "deletions": 9, "changeType": "MODIFIED"}, {"path": "docs/sessions.md", "additions": 14, "deletions": 2, "changeType": "MODIFIED"}, {"path": "crates/orion-tui/src/old_links.rs", "additions": 4, "deletions": 0, "changeType": "RENAMED"}], "commits": [{"oid": "a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9012345678", "messageHeadline": "Attach links to worktrees", "authoredDate": "2026-09-30T15:02:00Z", "authors": [{"login": "shot-user", "name": "Shot User"}]}, {"oid": "b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f901234567891", "messageHeadline": "Open a saved link in the browser", "authoredDate": "2026-10-01T10:20:00Z", "authors": [{"login": "shot-user", "name": "Shot User"}]}, {"oid": "c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f90123456789123", "messageHeadline": "Show the pull request once, not twice", "authoredDate": "2026-10-02T11:45:00Z", "authors": [{"login": "reviewer", "name": "Reviewer"}]}, {"oid": "d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9012345678912345", "messageHeadline": "Docs: links on the sessions page", "authoredDate": "2026-10-03T07:05:00Z", "authors": [{"login": "shot-user", "name": "Shot User"}]}], "statusCheckRollup": [{"__typename": "CheckRun", "name": "build (ubuntu-latest)", "workflowName": "CI", "status": "COMPLETED", "startedAt": "2026-10-03T07:06:02Z", "detailsUrl": "https://github.com/oliverkidd/orion/actions/runs/201", "conclusion": "SUCCESS", "completedAt": "2026-10-03T07:10:20Z"}, {"__typename": "CheckRun", "name": "build (macos-latest)", "workflowName": "CI", "status": "COMPLETED", "startedAt": "2026-10-03T07:06:02Z", "detailsUrl": "https://github.com/oliverkidd/orion/actions/runs/202", "conclusion": "SUCCESS", "completedAt": "2026-10-03T07:13:41Z"}, {"__typename": "CheckRun", "name": "test (ubuntu-latest)", "workflowName": "CI", "status": "COMPLETED", "startedAt": "2026-10-03T07:06:03Z", "detailsUrl": "https://github.com/oliverkidd/orion/actions/runs/203", "conclusion": "SUCCESS", "completedAt": "2026-10-03T07:15:09Z"}, {"__typename": "CheckRun", "name": "test (macos-latest)", "workflowName": "CI", "status": "COMPLETED", "startedAt": "2026-10-03T07:06:03Z", "detailsUrl": "https://github.com/oliverkidd/orion/actions/runs/204", "conclusion": "SUCCESS", "completedAt": "2026-10-03T07:19:30Z"}, {"__typename": "CheckRun", "name": "clippy", "workflowName": "CI", "status": "COMPLETED", "startedAt": "2026-10-03T07:06:04Z", "detailsUrl": "https://github.com/oliverkidd/orion/actions/runs/205", "conclusion": "SUCCESS", "completedAt": "2026-10-03T07:09:12Z"}, {"__typename": "CheckRun", "name": "ru